# Build context for the server image (Dockerfile) — an ALLOWLIST (hashimoto
# H-11): everything is excluded, then only what the pack stage needs comes
# back: web/ (the package), packs/skills (the vendored-skills gate re-hashes
# every pinned file) and LICENSE. A local .env or key file can never reach the
# builder or its cache.
*
!web
!packs/skills
!LICENSE
**/node_modules
web/dist
web/packs
web/coverage
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
